    "6": {
      "note": "Dismiss actions bypass target lookup but require a nonempty itemId, a published dismissible row and exactly matching kind. Missing itemId yields 400, unknown item yields 404, and a published non-dismissible row yields 409 not-dismissible before kind comparison; kind mismatch yields 400. A matching dismissible row returns 202 plus a DismissalIntent carrying the published actionable fingerprint. Non-dismiss actions require a target (400 if absent), a known target (404 otherwise) and a published enabled action (409 if absent or disabled); enabled actions return 202. There is no actionable-drift-only missing-target exemption.",
